WEBVTT

00:30.580 --> 00:32.940
Beautiful day!

00:58.270 --> 01:00.360
It's gotten hot.

01:00.440 --> 01:03.500
Something wrong with it?

01:05.140 --> 01:08.080
I think the deck's bro--

01:19.090 --> 01:21.220
You like it?

01:22.430 --> 01:24.920
Yeah! It looks great!

01:26.460 --> 01:29.130
- Come on! Let's go!
- G-Go where?

01:29.200 --> 01:30.630
Don't ask questions.
Just follow me!

01:30.700 --> 01:33.430
- Follow you where!?
- Just follow!

03:34.690 --> 03:36.960
<i>What did you say?</i>

03:37.190 --> 03:39.720
<i>The outfit that you gave me...</i>

03:39.800 --> 03:42.930
<i>marks the anniversary</i>
<i>of our first date.</i>

03:43.000 --> 03:45.200
<i>So why do I have to date you</i>
<i>on Sunday--</i>

03:45.270 --> 03:47.430
my only day off!

03:47.510 --> 03:49.940
What's wrong with spending
one day with me?

03:50.010 --> 03:51.410
But why?

03:51.480 --> 03:54.740
Fine! Don't bother.

03:54.810 --> 03:58.440
What is going on in her head?

04:06.320 --> 04:07.950
Ai, wait up!

04:09.860 --> 04:11.420
Two students, please.

04:14.130 --> 04:16.330
Okay, I got 'em.

04:16.400 --> 04:19.390
Let's skip the movie.

04:19.470 --> 04:21.870
It's just sittin' in the dark.

04:21.940 --> 04:25.640
Change your mind BEFORE
I buy the tickets!

04:26.380 --> 04:28.210
I'm a video girl.

04:28.280 --> 04:31.840
You think I want to watch
somebody else's flick?

04:31.920 --> 04:33.580
Maybe not.

04:33.650 --> 04:37.610
But are you gonna
pay me back for these?

04:37.690 --> 04:40.120
- Let me clear one thing up for you.
- What?

04:40.190 --> 04:44.630
On a date, a guy naturally
takes a girl...

04:44.700 --> 04:47.100
where she wants to go.

04:47.160 --> 04:49.100
And he pretends to like it.

04:49.170 --> 04:53.570
What's the big idea lecturing me
at a time like this?

04:54.640 --> 04:58.270
You sayin' I'm wrong?

04:58.340 --> 04:59.970
You win.

05:00.040 --> 05:04.040
Where do you want to go?
Let's hear it.

05:06.080 --> 05:09.580
It's a strike!
The man is an expert!

05:09.650 --> 05:11.520
Keep bowling like that
and you'll throw out your back.

05:11.590 --> 05:14.290
Quit praising strangers
and bowl your first frame.

05:15.430 --> 05:18.590
Stop distracting me and I will!

05:18.660 --> 05:21.000
Here comes the perfect game!

05:32.510 --> 05:34.310
You filthy little pig!

05:36.380 --> 05:38.080
- C'mon!
- H-Hey!

05:40.420 --> 05:45.750
It's your worn-out slapstick
that gets me slapped!

05:45.820 --> 05:48.820
Chill out! It's your turn.

05:50.960 --> 05:53.760
First thing to remember
is to bowl toward the pins.

05:53.830 --> 05:55.770
You know that, huh?

05:59.370 --> 06:01.570
Snap out of it, kid.

06:01.640 --> 06:04.510
It's our big day.
What's a little fever?

06:07.340 --> 06:09.750
Revenge!

06:09.810 --> 06:10.840
Why you!

06:10.920 --> 06:13.110
- Take this!
- You started it!

06:13.180 --> 06:14.850
- I'm gonna finish it!
- Weirdo!

06:14.920 --> 06:20.480
- Don't give me that!
- You tryin' to kill me?

06:27.160 --> 06:30.570
I knew we shouldn't
have gone bowling.

06:30.630 --> 06:32.870
Hey, say something.

06:41.180 --> 06:42.650
There she goes again.

06:58.230 --> 07:00.160
What do you think
you're doing?

07:00.230 --> 07:04.170
Keep it down.
This takes total concentration.

07:09.210 --> 07:13.640
Easy does it--

07:15.780 --> 07:17.710
All right!

07:21.690 --> 07:23.750
100 yen.

07:29.890 --> 07:31.790
Okay!

07:59.790 --> 08:02.690
What are you going to do
with all of these!?

08:08.700 --> 08:11.570
Aren't they cute?
Soft and fuzzy!

08:11.640 --> 08:15.500
Come on! We got other things
to worry about!

08:15.570 --> 08:18.010
I'm flat broke!

08:18.080 --> 08:20.770
I don't even have money
for the train home!

08:20.840 --> 08:22.540
"Don't be so grouchy."

08:22.610 --> 08:26.240
"That's why you're called
'Dateless'!"

08:26.320 --> 08:31.310
Don't you get it?
We can't even go home now!

08:32.290 --> 08:34.420
I get it!
I'll find a way.

08:36.460 --> 08:41.830
Hurry, hurry!
Step right up!

08:41.900 --> 08:45.670
Such cute toys for only 500 yen!

08:45.740 --> 08:48.140
Do you have the guts?
Just 500 yen!

08:48.210 --> 08:51.040
Win at paper-scissors-rock
and I'll throw in a kiss!

08:51.110 --> 08:52.510
Come one, come all!

08:52.580 --> 08:55.480
Ai, the "kiss"
is going overboard.

08:55.550 --> 08:57.810
I'm yer first customer!

08:57.880 --> 09:01.150
You ain't lyin', right?
I win, I get a kiss?

09:01.220 --> 09:02.450
Thank you!

09:07.490 --> 09:08.890
Go!

09:08.960 --> 09:10.860
Thank you!

09:10.930 --> 09:13.960
I'm outta luck!

09:14.030 --> 09:17.090
- I'm next!
- Me! Me!

09:17.170 --> 09:19.900
- I wanna kiss!
- Give me a chance!

09:21.370 --> 09:22.810
Rock-scissors-paper!

09:22.870 --> 09:24.310
Rock-scissors-paper!

09:24.370 --> 09:25.840
Rock-scissors-paper!

09:25.910 --> 09:27.310
Rock-scissors-paper!

09:27.380 --> 09:28.810
Rock-scissors-paper!

09:28.880 --> 09:30.310
Rock-scissors-paper!

09:45.060 --> 09:47.730
I can't believe
you didn't lose once.

09:47.800 --> 09:52.170
I always know what my opponent's
gonna choose.

09:53.000 --> 09:57.000
Video girls are made
to know men's minds.

09:57.070 --> 09:59.130
Oh, yeah.
There's one left.

09:59.210 --> 10:01.940
Think of it as payback
for the dress.

10:03.510 --> 10:05.680
- Hey!
- Just take it.

10:05.750 --> 10:08.450
Think of it as a present from me.

10:11.990 --> 10:13.460
Is something wrong?

10:18.130 --> 10:19.430
I think I'm thirsty!

10:27.870 --> 10:31.500
You overdid it today, that's all.

10:31.580 --> 10:34.810
I ain't that delicate--

10:40.050 --> 10:43.040
A,B,C,D...

10:43.120 --> 10:44.320
What's that mean?

10:45.420 --> 10:46.910
<i>What should I do?</i>

10:46.990 --> 10:51.290
<i>I finally got Yota</i>
<i>to take me out on a date.</i>

10:51.360 --> 10:55.090
D,E,F,G--

10:55.170 --> 10:57.660
Just makin' a joke.

11:00.940 --> 11:02.630
Whatssa matter?

11:02.710 --> 11:03.830
Somebody out there?

11:03.910 --> 11:06.470
I didn't--

11:12.120 --> 11:13.520
It's Moemi.

11:24.130 --> 11:28.930
Weren't you supposed to be
bringing us together?

11:32.000 --> 11:33.600
Then why?

11:33.900 --> 11:35.270
I--

11:35.810 --> 11:37.210
I mean--

11:44.350 --> 11:46.780
What do you "mean"?

11:47.850 --> 11:50.750
- What's that?
- Date money.

11:50.820 --> 11:52.350
Go after Moemi.

11:52.420 --> 11:53.820
"Go after"--

11:53.890 --> 11:57.090
Go after her! Catch up!
Bump right into her!

11:57.160 --> 11:59.760
- Be a man!
- I'm not that kinda--

12:02.800 --> 12:06.000
Give it your best.
I'm headed home.

12:06.070 --> 12:07.560
Wait, Ai!

12:28.630 --> 12:29.650
Ai!

12:32.660 --> 12:34.830
Ai!

13:30.250 --> 13:32.480
Are you okay?

13:39.100 --> 13:41.220
<i>So this is snow.</i>

13:43.070 --> 13:44.860
<i>Never saw it before.</i>

13:47.070 --> 13:50.530
<i>It feels so cool</i>
<i>against my skin.</i>

14:00.320 --> 14:04.190
<i>I can't do this on a date.</i>

14:06.220 --> 14:07.950
Hey, Ai!

14:08.020 --> 14:10.150
What's the matter?
Are you in pain?

14:13.960 --> 14:15.360
Gotcha!

14:16.600 --> 14:21.060
I just wanted you
to carry me through town.

14:23.610 --> 14:26.670
I was kidding.
Good as new.

14:26.740 --> 14:29.010
Y-Yota?

14:29.610 --> 14:31.810
How could you?

14:31.880 --> 14:34.980
I--I was really worried!

14:35.050 --> 14:36.920
I--I--

14:36.990 --> 14:40.720
Date's over!
I'll see the movie alone!

14:40.790 --> 14:42.020
Yota--

14:47.930 --> 14:49.730
Y-Yota--

14:58.070 --> 15:02.810
Who does she think she is?
Making a fool of me!

15:04.410 --> 15:06.470
Making me miss the theater!

15:06.550 --> 15:09.450
- Yota!
- Takashi!

15:09.520 --> 15:11.580
Whatcha doin' out here?

15:13.590 --> 15:16.360
Movie tickets for you
and Moemi?

15:16.430 --> 15:17.950
Smooth move, Yota.

15:18.030 --> 15:19.930
What? It's not Moemi?

15:20.000 --> 15:23.300
You! You're comin' with me!

15:23.370 --> 15:24.530
Get movin'!

15:24.600 --> 15:28.900
H-Hey, Yota! Leggo!
O-Okay! Don't drag me!

15:39.620 --> 15:42.610
It's a romance, isn't it?

15:44.890 --> 15:47.620
I hate this kinda stuff.

15:47.690 --> 15:50.860
It's free, so shut up!

15:50.930 --> 15:53.420
What crawled up your butt?

15:53.500 --> 15:55.430
I'm fine.

15:58.470 --> 16:02.500
<i>And now for our</i>
<i>feature presentation!</i>

16:02.570 --> 16:05.700
<i>Please enjoy the show.</i>

16:05.780 --> 16:08.070
Excuse me.
Is this seat taken?

16:08.140 --> 16:09.410
Help yourself.

16:09.480 --> 16:10.640
Niimai!

16:11.650 --> 16:12.980
- Hi!
- Oh!

16:13.820 --> 16:14.840
Alone?

16:15.920 --> 16:18.450
I'm dating Yota today.

16:21.990 --> 16:25.190
Tell you what, why don't we
switch seats?

16:25.260 --> 16:28.320
T-That's okay.
I like the aisle--

16:28.400 --> 16:30.060
I insist.

16:53.160 --> 16:55.180
"Wearing the clothes
you gave me...

16:55.260 --> 16:57.920
on the occasion of our
first date."

16:57.990 --> 17:02.020
Hey, sweetie.
Join me for tea?

17:02.770 --> 17:04.360
I'll buy ya some tea.

17:04.430 --> 17:06.560
- Gimme your hand.
- My hand?

17:09.070 --> 17:10.200
There.

17:11.540 --> 17:15.640
Go find some other
lucky girl. Bye.

17:50.110 --> 17:52.740
"I'm in love with Takashi!"

17:53.320 --> 17:58.810
<i>Moemi sees nothing but Takashi.</i>

18:01.790 --> 18:03.820
Where 'ya goin'?

18:03.890 --> 18:06.190
Bathroom.

18:26.980 --> 18:32.150
And Takashi won't do a thing
to return her feelings!

18:32.220 --> 18:34.320
Poor Moemi!
The poor girl!

18:52.180 --> 18:54.610
Again?

18:54.680 --> 18:57.980
This thing's melting.
I'll have to get a new one.

19:09.760 --> 19:11.280
That's it!

19:14.260 --> 19:15.760
Thank you for coming.

19:21.670 --> 19:22.970
Damn it!

19:27.580 --> 19:30.210
The dummy!
She was saying that stuff for me!

19:32.620 --> 19:36.520
She wasn't feeling well!
She was just pretending!

19:43.830 --> 19:45.800
S-Sorry!

19:51.230 --> 19:55.500
You're the one
who wanted to go out today.

19:55.570 --> 19:58.570
You didn't have to call it off
halfway through!

20:08.790 --> 20:10.480
<i>You're stupid, Ai!</i>

20:10.550 --> 20:14.420
<i>But you're no stupider</i>
<i>than I am!</i>

20:21.970 --> 20:27.030
<i>Ai! You waited for me.</i>

20:35.150 --> 20:37.270
Now I get my revenge!

20:41.050 --> 20:42.350
You again?

20:46.360 --> 20:48.290
- Come on!
- Hey!

20:52.500 --> 20:58.130
<i>Of course it's not her.</i>
<i>Why would she wait?</i>

20:59.870 --> 21:02.360
Can't even recognize a face?

21:06.840 --> 21:10.140
- Ai!
- Over here!

21:18.990 --> 21:20.220
Ai.

21:20.290 --> 21:24.160
The snow cooled me down.
Fever's all better.

21:28.000 --> 21:29.160
Here--

21:31.370 --> 21:32.840
Why you--

21:35.740 --> 21:37.000
Hey!

21:37.870 --> 21:39.670
Wait up!

21:39.740 --> 21:41.510
Come 'n' get me!

21:43.850 --> 21:46.440
- You okay?
- 'Course I am.

21:46.520 --> 21:49.150
Geez, your clothes
are soaking wet!

21:49.220 --> 21:51.090
Feels good. Really.

21:51.150 --> 21:53.250
If you don't change,
you're gonna catch cold.

21:53.320 --> 21:54.050
Don't wanna.

21:54.120 --> 21:55.920
- You'll catch cold!
- No!

21:56.660 --> 21:58.860
- Change 'em!
- No!

21:58.930 --> 22:02.230
- Take 'em off!
- No!

22:04.470 --> 22:05.940
Ai!

22:08.140 --> 22:11.970
I wanna keep 'em on all day.

22:15.210 --> 22:18.180
"Wearing clothes Yota gave Ai...

22:18.250 --> 22:21.150
on the occasion
of their first date."

22:23.420 --> 22:25.120
Ai.

22:32.930 --> 22:35.460
What am I gonna do with you?

22:35.530 --> 22:37.160
Yota.

22:37.230 --> 22:38.930
Let's go.

25:30.910 --> 25:34.070
That's cruel, Niimai!

25:36.810 --> 25:38.980
I'm in love with you!

25:45.720 --> 25:49.020
I don't believe it.
I think I'm jealous.

25:56.400 --> 25:57.590
Yota.

26:06.880 --> 26:09.780
- Hello--
<i>- Hello? Moteuchi?</i>

26:12.320 --> 26:13.250
Moemi.

26:13.320 --> 26:17.780
You're not telling Yota
about your little crush, are you!?

26:17.850 --> 26:19.760
Don't yell at me!

26:19.820 --> 26:23.090
You're the one
who was angling for her.

26:23.160 --> 26:25.750
Why am I the one
catching the fish?

26:25.830 --> 26:30.060
It's okay. I knew
it'd end up this way.

26:30.130 --> 26:32.930
- And you don't mind?
- Mind what?

26:33.000 --> 26:35.400
I love you, Moemi!
